<span begin="01:49.888" end="01:51.048">apart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.240" end="01:57.328"><span begin="01:54.240" end="01:54.432">And </span><span begin="01:54.432" end="01:54.864">it </span><span begin="01:54.864" end="01:55.112">just </span><span begin="01:55.112" end="01:55.368">don't </span><span begin="01:55.368" end="01:55.600">make </span><span begin="01:55.600" end="01:56.120">sense </span><span begin="01:56.120" end="01:56.344">to </span><span begin="01:56.344" end="01:57.328">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.560" end="02:01.520"><span begin="01:59.560" end="01:59.800">I </span><span begin="01:59.800" end="02:00.096">really </span><span begin="02:00.096" end="02:00.728">don't </span><span begin="02:00.728" end="02:01.520">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.600" end="02:07.504"><span begin="02:04.600" end="02:04.888">Why </span><span begin="02:04.888" end="02:05.208">you </span><span begin="02:05.208" end="02:05.584">stick </span><span begin="02:05.584" end="02:05.856">right </span><span begin="02:05.856" end="02:06.336">next </span><span begin="02:06.336" end="02:06.704">to </span><span begin="02:06.704" end="02:07.504">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.032" end="02:11.944"><span begin="02:10.032" end="02:10.624">Wherever </span><span begin="02:10.624" end="02:11.120">I </span><span begin="02:11.120" end="02:11.944">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.512" end="02:22.848"><span begin="02:16.512" end="02:16.768">You're </span><span begin="02:16.768" end="02:17.672">my </span><span begin="02:18.032" end="02:18.968">my </span><span begin="02:19.344" end="02:20.296">my </span><span begin="02:21.000" end="02:21.296">my </span><span begin="02:21.296" end="02:21.592">kind </span><span begin="02:21.592" end="02:21.864">of </span><span begin="02:21.864" end="02:22.848">woman</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.880" end="02:33.144"><span begin="02:26.880" end="02:28.200">My </span><span begin="02:28.464" end="02:29.432">oh </span><span begin="02:29.432" end="02:30.464">my </span><span begin="02:31.400" end="02:31.984">what </span><span begin="02:31.984" end="02:32.392">a </span><span begin="02:32.392" end="02:33.144">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.248" end="02:43.704"><span begin="02:37.248" end="02:37.608">You're </span><span begin="02:37.608" end="02:38.608">my </span><span begin="02:38.896" end="02:39.848">my </span><span begin="02:40.216" end="02:41.088">my </span><span begin="02:41.808" end="02:42.160">my </span><span begin="02:42.160" end="02:42.464">kind </span><span begin="02:42.464" end="02:42.736">of </span><span begin="02:42.736" end="02:43.704">woman</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.776" end="02:50.536"><span begin="02:47.776" end="02:47.968">And </span><span begin="02:47.968" end="02:48.168">I'm </span><span begin="02:48.168" end="02:48.496">down </span><span begin="02:48.496" end="02:48.768">on </span><span begin="02:48.768" end="02:49.112">my </span><span begin="02:49.112" end="02:49.792">hands </span><span begin="02:49.792" end="02:50.128">and </span><span begin="02:50.128" end="02:50.536">knees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.744" end="02:53.056"><span begin="02:50.744" end="02:51.048">Begging </span><span begin="02:51.048" end="02:51.384">you </span><span begin="02:51.384" end="02:52.024">please </span><span begin="02:52.024" end="02:53.056">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.320" end="02:55.688"><span begin="02:53.320" end="02:53.616">Show </span><span begin="02:53.616" end="02:53.976">me </span><span begin="02:53.976" end="02:54.328">your </span><span begin="02:54.328" end="02:55.688">world</span></p></div></body></tt>